ompletion and compaction logic**\n\n**Patching standalone compaction tests and assertions**\n\n**Allowing paused to prepared transition with attempts**"},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-rs_0fffa506fcf94449016a9a1b3ea14887d098fa3288c66decc2","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":61107,"startedSeq":61106,"endedSeq":61107,"timestamp":"1788484416Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"\n\n**Adding automatic test assertions for operations**"},{"id":"assistant-message-root-msg_0fffa506fcf94449016a9a1b40a5c087d0ace8bb58535015ac","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":61243,"startedSeq":61108,"endedSeq":61243,"timestamp":"1788484416Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"权威模型要求 actor 先提交 durable state，再在 actor 外启动 effect，所以恢复后的 Tool 应是 `PREPARED`，旧测试的 `RUNNING` 期待已过时；`PAUSED -> PREPARED` 也是恢复调度的合法转换。另一个真实缺陷是：Run 已完成后触发的 threshold compaction 仍记在已关闭 Run 下，却没有自己的 operation 边界。我会先收紧测试，要求“活跃 Run 内 compaction 是 Run step；已完成 Run 后 compaction 是带 `parentRunId` provenance 的独立 Compaction operation”，再修正记录归属。"},{"id":"tool-call-exec-c025fcca-218e-447d-8cfd-e4dae60fe431","kind":"toolCall","title":"Editing files","status":"completed","toolCallId":"exec-c025fcca-218e-447d-8cfd-e4dae60fe431","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":61245,"startedSeq":61244,"endedSeq":61245,"timestamp":"1788484428Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-rs_0fffa506fcf94449016a9a1b518a3c87d0a00101f900b41ef8","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":61248,"startedSeq":61247,"endedSeq":61248,"timestamp":"1788484434Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"\